The ontology is the constitutional layer of the entire platform.

With this addition, the IOS now has a complete semantic architecture:

Institutional Ontology
        │
        ▼
Entities
        │
        ▼
Relationships
        │
        ▼
Signals
        │
        ▼
Patterns
        │
        ▼
Knowledge Graph
        │
        ▼
APIs
        │
        ▼
Policy Parser
IOS Validator
Governance Score
Institution Mapper
        │
        ▼
Institutional Intelligence
        │
        ▼
AI Governance Platform

This progression mirrors mature enterprise knowledge systems. The ontology provides a stable semantic contract that allows every framework, dataset, API, graph, and AI capability in the repository to speak the same language, enabling long-term interoperability and extensibility.
